/*
 * td5_dtc_table.h - Td5 fault-code (X-Y) -> description / P-code lookup.
 *
 * Auto-generated from the TD5SPY canonical fault list (211 entries, all 35
 * categories). Bit index = (X-1)*8 + (Y-1); X = 1-based byte, Y = 1-based bit.
 * (L)=logged/historic bank, (C)=current/active bank.
 *
 * NOTE: P-codes are INFERRED display hints only - the Td5 is not OBD-II and
 * emits no P-codes; each is the nearest standard code for that fault function.
 * Faults with no sensible OBD-II equivalent have an empty pcode "".
 */

